{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわっほーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近暗くなるのが早いですね冬が近づいてきたのかな〜(・ω・) \n 今日ベリと服装が似すぎて。撮ってもらいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHESKV71WQ7YZ1N5TRJVXXQW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"左ベリ、右まなか\n靴下まで一緒ﾍ(･_|"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" 今日は収録がありました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん写真撮ったどーん( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHESKW5TDN0WCV7A0KV9NNSH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リサとあかねん。\n小さい頃から耳たぶが好きです。触りたくなる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHESKX6P7SSGF7SVJGAGMDXY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りさぁああ|ω・)一緒にいてラクです。変なテンションにあわせてくれるの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近のマイブームはすべての言葉に小さい文字をつけて話すこと。\nそうなの。→しょうなのそれやばい。→しょれやばいめっちゃ面白い。→めっしゃおもしょろいりさ。→りしゃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな感じでずーーっとこれで話し続けるのがマイブームです。リサはこれにのってくれて、一緒にずっとこれで話してます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も楽しかったです。｡o@(･_･)@o｡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHESKYAN7M3EE0T45GVQW067","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メガネから指さんこんにちわ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"志田愛佳"}],"source":"archive"}